  "id": "peer-tutoring",
  "term": "peer tutoring",
  "definition": "Peer tutoring is a flexible teaching method in which students are paired so that one student acts as the tutor and another as the tutee. Typically, a higher-achieving student helps a lower-achieving student with academic material, and this approach has been studied for academic, social, and psychological effects.",
